title: [+ ddp_name +]'s Turn
new-page: true
face-image: img/ddp.jpg
on-arrival: ddp_turn_taken = 1;
view-if: ddp_turn_taken == 0 and not lvp_formed
tags: event

= [+ ddp_name +]'s Turn

The [+ ddp_name +] will act

- @rally
- @labor_affairs

@rally
title: Rally
on-arrival: ddp_rally_timer = 6 if next_election_time - time > 6 and not (year == 1928 and month == 1); ddp_rally_timer = 2 if (year == 1928 and month == 1) or (next_election_time - time <= 6)
view-if: ddp_rally_timer <= 0 and not (labor_minister_party == ddp_name and labor_affairs_timer == 0 and strike_term_seen == 0)

The [+ ddp_name +] will hold a rally

- @sa_disrupt
- @class_collaboration
- @rally_welfare
- @rally_nationalism
- @rally_democracy
- @rally_lautenbach
- @rally_local

@class_collaboration
title: The class collaboration of the proletariat with the bourgeoisie.
view-if: ddp_leader == "Mahraun"
on-arrival: old_middle_ddp += 3*(1-ddp_dissent); new_middle_ddp += 2*(1-ddp_dissent); workers_ddp += 2*(1-ddp_dissent) if workers_schleicher_bonus > 0; unemployed_ddp += 2*(1-ddp_dissent) if workers_schleicher_bonus > 0; workers_ddp += 2*(1-ddp_dissent) if workers_schleicher_bonus > 1; unemployed_ddp += 2*(1-ddp_dissent) if workers_schleicher_bonus > 1; ddp_liberal_strength += 3; ddp_labor_dissent -= 3; ddp_liberal_dissent -= 3; ddp_business_dissent -= 3; ddp_bourgeois_dissent -= 3; ddp_autocratization += 1; dvp_right += 1; ddp_right += 1; lvp_right += 1

The [+ ddp_name +]'s mesage of class collaboration appeals to all but the class conscious. [? if workers_schleicher_bonus > 0 : Schleicher's united labor front  ?] [? if workers_schleicher_bonus > 1 : and popularity  ?] [? if workers_schleicher_bonus > 0 : has opposition to corporatism tantamount to support for revolution in the eyes of many. ?]

@rally_welfare
title: The maintenance and expansion of social welfare programs.
view-if: welfare > 0 and (ddp_leader == "Lüders" or ddp_leader == "Lemmer" and not (ddp_lautenbach_adopted or lautenbach_adopted))
on-arrival: workers_ddp += 2*(1-ddp_dissent); new_middle_ddp += (1-ddp_dissent); workers_ddp += 2*(1-ddp_dissent) if welfare > 0; unemployed_ddp += 2*(1-ddp_dissent) if welfare > 0; new_middle_ddp += (1-ddp_dissent) if welfare > 0; unemployed_ddp += 2*(1-ddp_dissent) if welfare > 1; ddp_liberal_strength += 3; ddp_labor_strength += 3; ddp_labor_dissent -= 3; ddp_liberal_dissent -= 3;

The humanistic message appeals to women and the organized workers, whose benefits are the accomplishments of <span style="color: #586593;">liberal democracy</span>. [? if welfare > 1 : Expansions in welfare have made this message more effective. ?]

@rally_nationalism
title: Supporting war, nationalism, and militarism at all costs.
view-if: ddp_leader == "Stolper" or ddp_leader == "Dietrich"
on-arrival: ddp_autocratization += 1; nationalism += 3*(1 - ddp_dissent); workers_ddp += 1*(1-ddp_dissent) if ddp_autocratization >= 3; unemployed_ddp += 1*(1-ddp_dissent) if ddp_autocratization >= 3; pro_republic -= 3*(1-ddp_dissent) if ddp_autocratization >= 3; new_middle_ddp += 2*(1-ddp_dissent); old_middle_ddp += 2*(1-ddp_dissent); ddp_business_strength += 0.5 if (ddp_autocratization >= 3 and nationalism >= 60)

The [+ ddp_name +]'s speakers praise the military establishment and call for the reuinifaction of Germany.

[? if ddp_autocratization >= 3 : With nationalism increasingly popular within their party, the rally's speakers call for the cessation of reparations and dismantlement of democracy ?]

@rally_democracy
title: Expanding our nascent democracy and defending it against <span style="color: #808080;">dictatorship</span> and <span style="color: #7A3C00;">fascism</span>.
view-if: ddp_leader == "Maier" or ddp_leader == "Heuss" or ddp_leader == "Koch-Weser"
on-arrival: ddp_democratization -= 1; pro_republic += 3*(1 - ddp_dissent); workers_ddp += 1*(1-ddp_dissent) if ddp_democratization >= 3; unemployed_ddp += 1*(1-ddp_dissent) if ddp_democratization >= 3; new_middle_ddp += 2*(1-ddp_dissent) if democratization >= 3; old_middle_ddp += 2*(1-ddp_dissent) if democratization >= 3; ddp_liberal_strength += 3; ddp_left += 0.5 if pro_republic >= 70; lvp_left += 0.5 if pro_republic >= 70

The [+ ddp_name +] will defend the <span style="color: #000000;">rep</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">ubl</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ican</span> system and rail against the <span style="color: #808080;">monarchists</span> and <span style="color: #A00500;">communists</span> who threaten it.

[? if democratization < 3 : Talk of democracy does not excite the workers and middle classes as much as more practical issues. ?]
[? if democratization >= 3 : Since they have consistently made democratization a theme of their campaigns, the workers and middle classes are enthusiastic about their message. ?]

@rally_lautenbach
title: Support the Lautenbach plan!
view-if: return_to_normalcy == 0 and (ddp_lautenbach_adopted or lautenbach_adopted) and ddp_leader == "Lemmer"
on-arrival: new_middle_ddp += 3*(1-ddp_dissent); old_middle_ddp += 3*(1-ddp_dissent); workers_ddp += 1*(1-ddp_dissent); unemployed_ddp += 1*(1-ddp_dissent); rural_ddp += 1*(1-ddp_dissent); new_middle_ddp += 3*(1-ddp_dissent) if lautenbach_adopted; old_middle_ddp += 3*(1-ddp_dissent) if lautenbach_adopted; rural_ddp += 1*(1-ddp_dissent) if lautenbach_adopted; workers_ddp += 2*(1-ddp_dissent) if lautenbach_adopted; unemployed_ddp += 2*(1-ddp_dissent) if lautenbach_adopted;

The Lautenbach plan has become a popular rallying cry for the [+ ddp +]. The workers and employers see it as a necessary compromise. [? if not lautenbach_adopted: However, many are still skeptical whether the plan will actually prove effective. ?]

@rally_local
title: A mixture of various local and national concerns that resonate most with the audience.
view-if: welfare <= 0 and (ddp_leader == "Lüders" or (ddp_leader == "Lemmer" and not (ddp_lautenbach_adopted or lautenbach_adopted)))
on-arrival: workers_ddp += 2*(1-ddp_dissent); old_middle_ddp += 3*(1-ddp_dissent); new_middle_ddp += 3*(1-ddp_dissent); unemployed_ddp += 1*(1-ddp_dissent);

The [+ ddp_name +]'s speakers have gauged the mood and are speaking to the issues that seem to most affect workers, employers, and women in this moment.

@sa_disrupt
title: The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazi</span> <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> has disrupted the [+ ddp_name +] rally!
view-if: sa_force > 25 and not sa_banned and not return_to_normalcy

The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazi</span> <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> has disrupted the [+ ddp_name +] rally!

- @rally_police
- @rally_cancel

@rally_police
title: The [+ ddp_name +] has called the police to protect their rally
view-if: ddp_ideology == "Left"
on-arrival: police_protect_success = prussian_police_loyalty * prussian_police_militancy * prussian_police_strength*2 - sa_militancy*sa_strength;

The [+ ddp_name +] has called the police to protect their rally

go-to: rally_police_win if police_protect_success >= 0; rally_police_lose if police_protect_success < 0

@rally_cancel
view-if: ddp_ideology != "Left"
title: The [+ ddp_name +] have canceled their rally

The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> have won this show of strength.

@rally_police_win
title: The police have prevailed!

The police successfully protected the [+ ddp_name +]'s rally, so it can go ahead as usual.

- @rally_welfare
- @rally_nationalism
- @rally_democracy
- @rally_lautenbach
- @rally_local

@rally_police_lose
title: The police were unable or unwilling to hold back the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> mob.
on-arrival: new_middle_nsdap += 3; strife += 1

The <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**SA**</span> have won this show of strength.

@labor_affairs
title: Labor Affairs
subtitle: The industrial Ruhr region is aflame with labor unrest
view-if: labor_minister_party == ddp_name and labor_affairs_timer == 0 and strike_term_seen == 0

The industrial Ruhr region is aflame with labor unrest

- @support_labor
- @balance
- @support_employers

@support_labor
title: The [+ ddp_name +] will support labor in their demands... wait, what?
view-if: ddp_ideology == "Left" and ddp_leader == "Erkelenz"

Popular among the workers, this will alienate the bourgeoisie

go-to: labor_affairs.support_labor
                                   
@balance
title: The [+ ddp_name +] will try to strike a compromise between the sides.
view-if: ddp_ideology == "Left" or (ddp_ideology == Moderate and (ddp_leader == "Heuss" or ddp_leader == "Lemmer" or ddp_leader == "Lüders"))

Both sides need to share the pain in the current crisis.

go-to: labor_affairs.balance

@support_employers
title: The [+ ddp_name +] will support the employers in their demands.
view-if: ddp_ideology == "Right" or (ddp_ideology == Moderate and (ddp_leader == "Stolper" or ddp_leader == "Dietrich" or ddp_leader == "Koch-Weser" or ddp_leader == "Hellpach"))

Popular among the bourgeoisie, much less so among the workers.

go-to: labor_affairs.support_employers